sequenceDiagram
    participant EmployeeUI as Employee Settings
    participant EmployeeSDK as Employee WalletSdk
    participant MasterUI as Wellness Admin Settings
    participant MasterSDK as Wellness Admin WalletSdk
    participant Secure as Protected Storage

    EmployeeUI->>EmployeeSDK: createConfigurationRequest()
    EmployeeSDK->>EmployeeSDK: Create challenge and device-bound request
    EmployeeSDK-->>EmployeeUI: ConfigurationRequestView with opaque QR
    MasterUI->>MasterSDK: inspectConfigurationRequest(qrValue)
    MasterSDK-->>MasterUI: Safe device and environment review
    MasterUI->>MasterSDK: createConfigurationUpdate(requestId)
    MasterSDK->>Secure: Read current provider configuration
    Secure-->>MasterSDK: Endpoint, headers, and new version
    MasterSDK->>MasterSDK: Encrypt for device and authorize update
    MasterSDK-->>MasterUI: ConfigurationUpdateView with opaque QR
    EmployeeUI->>EmployeeSDK: inspectConfigurationUpdate(qrValue)
    EmployeeSDK->>EmployeeSDK: Validate authorization, binding, expiry, replay, and version
    EmployeeSDK-->>EmployeeUI: Safe ConfigurationReview
    EmployeeUI->>EmployeeSDK: applyConfigurationUpdate(updateId)
    EmployeeSDK->>Secure: Save candidate configuration as pending
    EmployeeSDK->>EmployeeSDK: Run provider health check
    EmployeeSDK->>Secure: Promote candidate and remove previous configuration
    EmployeeSDK-->>EmployeeUI: ConfigurationOutcome
